WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.200
What's up guys, hope you're doing great.

00:04.200 --> 00:09.160
I would like to record a quick video to Zia and his team.

00:09.160 --> 00:12.640
Zia and his team are great developers.

00:12.640 --> 00:15.960
I'm working with them for quite a while.

00:15.960 --> 00:19.400
We've been working on a few projects,

00:19.400 --> 00:24.120
like implementing a custom solution for off-session payments

00:24.120 --> 00:28.360
and one-click upsells made for WOP,

00:28.360 --> 00:32.720
because we are using WOP as our main payment processor,

00:32.720 --> 00:36.640
and it was hard for us to integrate that

00:36.640 --> 00:39.000
with our funnel builder,

00:39.000 --> 00:42.440
and Zia and his team helped us to basically

00:43.440 --> 00:47.360
create and implement the whole flow into our system.

00:47.360 --> 00:51.000
And now with our own backend,

00:51.000 --> 00:55.160
we are basically processing one-click upsells,

00:55.160 --> 00:59.800
which are boosting our cash per customer quite a lot.

00:59.800 --> 01:03.960
So the whole project with Zia was amazing.

01:05.840 --> 01:08.960
I have almost nothing bad to say,

01:08.960 --> 01:10.800
like it was amazing,

01:10.800 --> 01:15.800
like the outcome that was promised was delivered,

01:16.600 --> 01:17.960
and not just that,

01:17.960 --> 01:20.760
Zia also implemented some extra features

01:20.760 --> 01:23.720
to maximize the user experience,

01:23.720 --> 01:26.960
like refilling the email into the checkouts

01:26.960 --> 01:31.480
and redirecting customers to failed payment pages

01:32.360 --> 01:36.120
when the payment was declined and much more.

01:36.120 --> 01:41.120
Then we were also working on some other stuff,

01:41.120 --> 01:45.560
