01:51.360 --> 01:56.360
and the tracking score is very good.

01:56.360 --> 02:00.640
I think it's like 97, 99%, which is absolutely phenomenal.

02:00.640 --> 02:03.880
So yeah, if you are thinking about working with Zia

02:03.880 --> 02:06.720
and his team, I would definitely recommend that.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.560
Zia is a great developer,

02:08.560 --> 02:11.680
